   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Embryot till kenyansk ombudsman g&#xf6;r studiebes&#xf6;k i sverige hos relevant ombudsm&#xe4;n och institutioner.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Public Complaints Standing Committe is currently hosted by the Ministry of Justice and Constitutional Affairs but it is to become an independent institution. The Swedish Institute will arrange a study visit to Sweden for 2 of the staff to meet with the Parliamentary Ombudsman, thematic ombudsmen and related institutions. The cost cover administration fees for Swedish Institute.</narrative>
